                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/6197: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Harbin</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Jenkins</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Harbin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-01-22T13:00:00+08:26"><hi rendition="#italic">January 22,
                                1920—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received January 23—9:54
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Semenoff has published an order alleged to be signed by Koichak appointing
                    Semenoff to full governmental authority over Eastern Siberia.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jenkins</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
